// The prompt presets shipped with IncreArt (DESIGN.md, Prompt presets),
// embedded in the app and written to prompt-presets/default-presets.rsn
// beside config.rsn on every start (so edits to that copy are lost: put
// your own presets in the task folders next to it instead).
//
// Modify style prompts read "Convert <image1> into <look>. Keep the
// composition, pose and identity unchanged." Styles that turn a flat image
// into 3D (Voxel, Animatronic) keep only the subject ("Keep the subject,
// pose and identity unchanged.") and have a negative prompt: kept to its
// composition, the model keeps the flat front view, and voxels seen face-on
// come out as 2D pixel art.
//
// A description loosely defines the name for someone who doesn't know the
// term, then says what you get. Artist, studio and brand names are left out.
PromptPresets {
    tasks: [
        PromptTask {
            name: "Modify style",
            description: "Redraw a reference image in another art style, keeping what it shows.",
            presets: [
                PromptPreset {
